     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><div xml:lang=\"fr\" lang=\"fr\"><hr/><p><b>French</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Narratif généré : CarteDeConcepts CdaBLToBooleanConceptMap</b></p><a name=\"CdaBLToBooleanConceptMap\"> </a><a name=\"hcCdaBLToBooleanConceptMap\"> </a><p>This mapping does not specify any particular context of use.</p><br/><p>Mapping de <a href=\"http://hl7.org/cda/stds/core/2.0.0-sd/StructureDefinition-BL.html\">BL: Boolean (V3 Data Type)</a> to <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#boolean\">boolean</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Code source</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>relation</b></td><td><b>Code cible</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Commentaire</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/cda/stds/core/2.0.0-sd/StructureDefinition-BL.html#s-BL.value\">BL.value</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#boolean#s-boolean\">boolean</a></td><td>0..*</td><td>todo</td><td>La valeur du datatype CDA BL alimente directement le datatype primitif FHIR boolean.</td></tr></table></div><div xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\"><hr/><p><b>English</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ConceptMap CdaBLToBooleanConceptMap</b></p><a name=\"en-CdaBLToBooleanConceptMap\"> </a><a name=\"en-hcCdaBLToBooleanConceptMap\"> </a><p>This mapping does not specify any particular context of use.</p><br/><p>Mapping from <a href=\"http://hl7.org/cda/stds/core/2.0.0-sd/StructureDefinition-BL.html\">BL: Boolean (V3 Data Type)</a> to <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#boolean\">boolean</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><t